==Alternative route==

''If for some reason you don't want to kill the smelly hermit, you can do several quests for him instead.''

You say, 'Do you have the Winds of Karana?'

: a hermit says, 'So you seek the two song sheets? If you truly want them, you will help the cause of the Unkempt Druids. Otherwiset[sic], you would have to fight me for it. So, which will it be? Will you help the Unkempt Druids or will you fight me?

''(this is why telling him you'll fight or kill causes him to attack)''

You say, 'I will help the Unkempt Druids'

: a hermit says, 'The Unkempt Druids are the voices of the trees and animals. We fight for the hunted prey and the vanishing forests. We are the true druids and rangers who fight for preservation of nature. If humanoid lives must be sacrificed to meet this goal, then so be it!'

You say, 'I will help'

: a hermit says, 'Wise decision. I ask you then, to go to the western plains of Karana. Seek a farmer named Linaya Sowlin. Bring me her heart. A heart for a song sheet. Fitting, don't you think?

